{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279955-wyrd-s-scion-2e-hub","id":1279955,"title":"Wyrd's Scion 2E Hub","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-10T13:22:44-08:00","id":1279955,"title":"Wyrd's Scion 2E Hub","content":"Here is collection of hacks and projects I use for my games with links to topic made about them. Mark - not all my chronicles use all of them - I always at least talk them with players if they are okay with idea.<br /> <br /> This post will be updated each time when I will add another hack or topic.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Questions:</span></b><br /> Series of Questions topics, where we dwell more into elements of <b>Scion</b> gameline.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1363003-2e-are-there-conditions-in-scion\">Are Conditions in Scion?</a></b> - Few mechanical advice on running Conditions and Fields in game.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1278246-2e-are-there-merits-in-scion\">Are Merits in Scion?</a></b> - Few mechanical advice on elements like Merits, for previous Storytellers of <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1421956-character-creation-scion-2e\"><b>Character Creation for Scion 2E </b></a>- All the help and question you will ask on it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1399768-legend-questions\"><b>Legend Questions</b></a> - Like topics name<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1420609-2e-how-long-each-tier-should-take\"><b>How long each Tier should take?</b></a> - Sessions time estimates<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432180-how-make-a-fair-fight\"><b>How make fair fight?</b></a> - Advises on encounter balancing in <b>Scion</b>. ( Not mine, but I support it )<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432506-healing-at-origin-tier\"><b>Healing at Origin Tier</b></a> - How works the rules and how to solve it<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1434114-2e-non-combatants-in-scion\"><b>Non-combatants in Scion</b></a> - How to utalize non-combatant character in action situations<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1433273-2e-scions-and-languages\"><b>Scions and Languages </b></a>- Questions about languages and scion powers<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1430498-using-wod-cod-games-to-build-up-scion%E2%80%99s-world-setting\"><b>WoD/CoD games in Scion</b></a> - Crossover gamelines ideas topic ( not mine, but I support it )<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Inspirations:</span></b><br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1421640-netflix-%E2%80%98blood-of-zeus%E2%80%99-as-scion-chronicle\">Netflix \u2018Blood of Zeus\u2019 as Scion chronicle</a> </b>- Anime-ish series that remixes Theoi Pantheon stories. Cool to watch and rather gory. Some inspirations for Theoi, their relationships in particular.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1401051-netflix-ragnarok-tv-series-as-scion-chronicle\"><b>Netflix Ragnarok TV series as Scion chronicle</b></a> - Cool TV show, looking almost exactly like <b>Scion: Origin</b> game in play!<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411783-percy-jackson-s-world-as-scion-series\">Percy Jackson's World as Scion series</a> </b>- A bit more high-fantasy take on <b>Scion</b>, but still with 'Gods in Hiding' trope in play!<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">New Stuff</span></b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432522-2e-denizens-collection\"><b>[2E] Denizens Collection</b></a> - Write-ups for Denizens not found in books<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1432402-2e-new-relics\"><b>[2E] New Relics</b></a> - Collection of fan made Relics to use<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1421326-2e-mortal-antagonists\">[2E] Mortal Antagonists</a> </b>\u2013 Small collection of Antagonists template for 2E based on \u2018normal people\u2019 to be used in you game. \ud83d\ude0a<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1431050-2e-fan-scion-bestiary\"><b>[2E] Scion Bestiary</b></a> - New Monsters to put your Scions against for.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">General ideas:</span></b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1424633-1001-scions-%E2%80%93-character-ideas\"><b>1001 Scions</b></a> \u2013 Character Ideas for PCs, NPCs and other character you need for your games \ud83d\ude09<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1358299-brands-in-the-world\">Brands in the World</a></b> - Some of business brands are using Myths symbols. What if Myths their basing their image are real powers behind those companies?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1338731-2e-change-of-divine-patron\"><b>Change of Divine Patron?</b></a> - Possibility of changing your Divine Patron ( Parent ) to god of other Pantheon, once or twice per chronicle.<span style=\"font-size:13px\"> Of course, for the God with very similar Purviews between Pantheon A and Pantheon B.</span><br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1424455-esotericism-in-scion\">Esotericism in Scion</a> </b> \u2013 Witchcraft, magical tradition and \u2018occult\u2019 in popular understanding in your game world<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1278952-exemplary-titans\">Exemplary Titans</a></b> - Which members of each Pantheon can be possible Titans - and what are sure Titans<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1274898-everyday-life-with-gods\"><b>Everyday life with Gods</b></a> - Debate topic about how looks like everyday interactions of Gods and mortals in vanilla Scion 2E setting The World - and how it works in game systems<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1395335-companion-theocentrism-evidance-dials\"><b>Evidance &amp; Theocentrism Dials </b></a>- Implications for the game world and mechanics on using optional rules from <b>Scion 2E Companion </b>about changing role of Gods in the game world.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1306739-ideas-of-chosen-scions\">Ideas of Chosen Scions</a></b> - Chosen Scions are new type of characters from 2E that were made when God patron has risen mere mortal to Scion level, not being parent to it. Topic for ideas on events like those.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1306621-monotheism-and-multipersonas-one-god-in-scion\"><b>Monotheism and Multipersonas One God in Scion</b></a> - topic for looking how Monotheism like in<i> 'American Gods' </i>- i.e. dozen of Jesus variants - can work in <b>Scion </b>setting.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1369974-mythologies-like-superhero-genre\">Mythologies like superhero genre</a> </b>- What are connections and similarities between superhero genere and mythologies, especially for <b>Scion</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1359863-old-pantheons-gods-with-modern-purviews\"><b>Old Gods with Modern Purviews</b></a> - How classical Pantheons Gods could take modern Purviews \u2013 for example, Internet.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1278657-pantheons-conflicts-regions\"><b>Pantheons conflict regions</b></a> - Places where interests of two or more Pantheons are crossing.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1278000-is-scion-origin-like-original-tomb-raider\"><b>Scion: Origin is like Tomb Raider</b></a> - Why to look into adventures of Lara Croft for inspirations.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1253809-conversion-storypath-elements-in-2e-storytelling-system-games\">Storypath elements in 2E Storytelling System games</a> </b>- Conversion topic between two 'sister' mechanics, to better understand difference between them and using Storypath elements in CoD games and vice versa.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1412385-2e-scion-series-ideas\"><b>Scion series ideas</b></a> - Ideas for series/chronicles/campagins in Scion universe.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1347874-origins-of-dragons-theories-and-researches\"><b>Origins of Dragons</b></a> - Theories and researches on various dragons in myths. Nice expansion for coming book <b>Scion: Dragon</b>!<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hacks:</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1278397-2e-bogovi-slavic-pantheon\">[2E] Bogi / Bogovi</a></b> - 2E Slavic Pantheon, fan created<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1329174-ephemeral-beings-in-scion-2e\"><b>[2E] Ephemeral Beings in Scion</b></a> - Various ghosts, spirits, angels, astral entities and many, many other 'immaterial, sentient' things - connected by main mechanics, and subdivided by particulars of each 'race', like in <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> setting and rules.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1275725-2e-setting-hack-gods-in-hiding-and-new-mythic-age\">[2E] Gods in Hiding and new Mythic Age</a> </b>- Setting Hack for making Scion 2E more like 'American Gods' and 1E Setting.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1412255-2e-gods-with-more-callings\"><b>[2E] Gods with more Callings</b></a> - Gods that should have more Callings than official pointed. Many have Titan Callings, also.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1302675-2e-new-gods-like-from-american-gods-of-gaiman\"><b>[2E] New Gods / Modern Titans ( like from 'American Gods' of Gaiman )</b></a> - What if Scion setting was having Pantheon composed of new ideas, like Conspiracy, Equality, Globalization, Liberty, Media, Money, Nationalism or Technology?<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279952-2e-new-purviews\">[2E] New Purviews</a></b> - New Purviews for Old Gods <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Optional - Atlantis:</span></b><br /> Topics about 'optional canon' Theros of Atlantis, shown in <b>Scion Companion - Mysteries of The World</b><br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1419601-companion-teros-of-atlantis-%E2%80%93-cosmology\">Teros of Atlantis \u2013 Cosmology</a> </b>\u2013 How to expand Theros Pantheon and it's Cosmology from Mysteries of 